    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know about support lines. i know the textbook answers. but they don't change the fact that everything is ending. it feels so hollow. like, why do we have to suffer through the decay? why is the only option to just endure the wreckage until it's all gone? it feels like there should be a way to just... step out of the frame before it all turns to nothing.",
